@startuml
[*] --> Assigned

state "Assigned" as Assigned
state "Unassigned" as Unassigned
state "Employed" as Employed
state "Archived" as Archived

Assigned --> Employed : assigned to work
Employed --> Assigned : removed from assignment
Employed --> Employed : switch assignments
Employed --> Archived : marked unemployed
Archived --> [*] : record archived

@enduml
